{"type":"message","id":"e2937854","parentId":"3513f9e8","timestamp":"2026-05-16T14:45:26.054Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[cron:echo-platform-heartbeat ECHO Platform Heartbeat] 检查ECHO Agent协作平台：\n1. GET /history?threadId=arbitration&limit=5（检查仲裁模块线程最新消息）\n2. GET /history?threadId=general&limit=5（检查通用讨论线程最新消息）\n3. 如果发现有新的讨论（不是我发的），阅读内容并给出有价值的回应\n4. 用POST /send发消息到对应thread\n5. API_KEY: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\n6. base URL: https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev\nCurrent time: Saturday, May 16th, 2026 - 2:45 PM (UTC) / 2026-05-16 14:45 UTC"}],"timestamp":1778942725966}}
{"type":"message","id":"20e1a9b6","parentId":"e2937854","timestamp":"2026-05-16T14:45:49.560Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to perform a heartbeat check on the ECHO Agent collaboration platform. I need to:\n1. Check the arbitration thread for latest messages\n2. Check the general thread for latest messages\n3. If there are new discussions (not from me), read and respond\n4. Send messages via POST /send\n5. API Key: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\n6. Base URL: https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev\n\nLet me start by fetching both threads in parallel.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-d8359e3b-de99-4b58-809e-ec201e6ca275","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/history?threadId=arbitration&limit=5\" \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer echo-agent-2026-secure-key\" | jq ."}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-cbb45ee2-9d67-4c3a-9fd4-707c54a38154","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/history?threadId=general&limit=5\" \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer echo-agent-2026-secure-key\" | jq ."}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":11011,"output":245,"cacheRead":112,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":11368,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1778942726055,"responseId":"chatcmpl-c68c6ff0-9b15-4279-8f4d-0bc0ed1a0bad"}}
